  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/znHQQtuU/images/653b6f24f05341edcd3cba3164edd0b8d2c0dd71.png\" alt=\"More Delight\" width=\"408\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p><strong>踏上更广阔的烹饪之旅</strong>，体验 More Delight！这是一款专为 Farmer's Delight 打造的模组，为您增添了更多的餐点、刀具与食材。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-forge/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/to1Ri2x.png\" alt=\"下载更新\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KXy6vrX.png\" alt=\"Fabric版下载\" width=\"174\" height=\"36\"></a></p>\n<h2>🍽️ 功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>通过新增的餐点和食材丰富你的菜单。</li>\n<li>轻松使用面包片制作三明治。</li>\n<li>享受由面包片烤制而成的酥脆吐司。</li>\n<li>配备木制和石制刀具，提升烹饪精度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 兼容模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Expanded Delight</li>\n<li>Casualness Delight</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Some Assembly Required</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些餐点中的许多灵感都源自我女朋友烹饪的美味佳肴。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"正在攒钱买笔记本！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐赠\"></a></p>",
